<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-1/4 (FIM 207.86).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-1/4 (FIM 207.86).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-1/8 at $45-1/4 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 207.86 markka. In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia A closed up 5.00 markka at 210.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/2 at $32-1/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 74.07 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.30 markka at 74.40.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded on Tuesday after closing down $0-5/8 at $19-3/4 on in New York last Thursday.</p>
<p>Rauma closed up 0.50 markka at 90.50 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
